---
/* L83 - the four things a public, checkable artifact has to contain. */
---

<figure class="fig">
  <div class="fig__frame">
    <img
      class="fig__picture"
      src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}illustrations/L83.jpg`}
      alt="A line drawing of an open cardboard box holding a notebook and a stack of envelopes, with a dark ribbon flowing into it."
    />
    <svg
      class="fig__svg"
      viewBox="0 0 640 340"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="L83-fig-title L83-fig-desc"
    >
      <title id="L83-fig-title">Four things to ship, and the one that points back at the evidence</title>
      <desc id="L83-fig-desc">
        Four stacked bands. The first is the repo: pure standard library, no install
        step, Apache-2.0, version 0.1.0. The second is the command: one line to
        type, with the price printed before the call and a spend cap of 0.25. The
        third is the raw evidence: runs/20261025-040448-mock.jsonl, battery hash
        fd9fb7c25685 and uuid 3dfd4c41-2b90-4eb7-88d3-1345c63feaf0. The fourth is
        the one finding: one sentence, one number, one boundary, with the condition
        that would change it. A prussian arrow runs from the finding band back up
        into the raw evidence band.
      </desc>
      <defs>
        <marker id="L83-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="var(--color-prussian)" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <!-- 1 the repo -->
      <rect x="30" y="56" width="580" height="48" fill="var(--color-ground)" stroke="var(--color-rule)" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="42" y="78" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink)">1 the repo</text>
      <text x="180" y="76" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">pure stdlib, no install step</text>
      <text x="180" y="94" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">Apache-2.0, version 0.1.0</text>

      <!-- 2 the command -->
      <rect x="30" y="116" width="580" height="48" fill="var(--color-ground)" stroke="var(--color-rule)" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="42" y="138" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink)">2 the command</text>
      <text x="180" y="136" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">one line to type</text>
      <text x="180" y="154" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">the price is printed before the call, spend cap 0.25</text>

      <!-- 3 the raw evidence -->
      <rect x="30" y="176" width="580" height="48" fill="var(--color-ground)" stroke="var(--color-rule)" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="42" y="198" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink)">3 the raw evidence</text>
      <text x="180" y="196" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">runs/20261025-040448-mock.jsonl</text>
      <text x="180" y="214" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">battery_hash fd9fb7c25685, uuid 3dfd4c41-2b90-4eb7-88d3-1345c63feaf0</text>

      <!-- 4 the one finding -->
      <rect x="30" y="236" width="580" height="48" fill="var(--color-ground)" stroke="var(--color-rule)" stroke-width="1" />
      <text x="42" y="258" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink)">4 one finding</text>
      <text x="180" y="256" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">one sentence, one number, one boundary</text>
      <text x="180" y="274" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">with the condition that would change it</text>

      <!-- the one authored motion: the finding points back at the raw file -->
      <path
        class="m-draw"
        style="--m-length: 100; --m-duration: 1.2s;"
        d="M 612 258 H 624 V 200 H 606"
        fill="none"
        stroke="var(--color-prussian)"
        stroke-width="1"
        marker-end="url(#L83-arrow)"
      />

      <text x="30" y="308" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">the raw file is the evidence; the report is a derived convenience</text>
      <text x="30" y="328" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">a reader who wants to check you opens the raw file, not the report</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="fig__caption">
    <span class="edge-code">figure L83</span>
    <span class="fig__caption-text">The repo, the command, the raw evidence and the one finding - and the last one points back at the file the number came from.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  /* scoped to this figure */
  .fig__svg {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
</style>
